[list]
[*][b]Library[/b], [b]Read[/b] and [b]Edit[/b]: the library, surface pages, the setup editor with editing and Save to Project, Find, View in 3D, New Material, the assistant's tools. Done: this version.[/*]
[*][color=#19f3ff]Next:[/color] [b]Make[/b]: materials for brand-new clothes and objects, from a model's own textures, picked from the game, or generated; a mesh's looks.[/*]
